# OCEANIS Digital Tool – Licensing Notice

**Licensing review initiated: 28 October 2026**

This repository contains the interactive digital implementation of the OCEANIS Framework.

**Previously published material**

Earlier repository content was distributed with a CC0 1.0 Universal public domain dedication.

The historical repository state is preserved at:
Git tag: pre-licence-review-2026-10-28

The previous CC0 legal text is retained in LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt.

Permissions validly granted under CC0 remain unaffected. The scope and authorisation of the earlier CC0 dedication are currently being reviewed.

**New contributions**

New original contributions made after the historical version identified above are not automatically dedicated under CC0.

The licensing arrangements for future software, documentation, illustrations and other resources are under review.

Until explicit licensing terms have been agreed and documented, new original material should not be added to public releases.

This notice does not itself grant a new licence or revoke any previously valid permissions.

**Official OCEANIS Framework**

The OCEANIS Framework is a separate, versioned research resource being prepared for publication on Zenodo.
OCEANIS Framework v0.9

**Reserved DOI:** 10.5281/zenodo.23724343 (not yet published).

The overarching Concept DOI for all versions of the framework will be added after publication.
The OCEANIS Framework and the interactive digital tool may have distinct authorship, copyright ownership and licensing arrangements.
